{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<link href=\"https://hangeul.pstatic.net/hangeul_static/css/nanum-myeongjo.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<link href=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/web_font/nexon_gothic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style type=\"text/css\">@font-face {font-family:'Cafe24Danjunghae';src:url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_twelve@1.1/Cafe24Danjunghae.woff') format('woff');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}\r\n            /* 기본 */\r\n            .font_NMr {font-family:'NanumMyeongjo' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMeb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NGL {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light' !important;}\r\n            .font_NGB {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Bold' !important;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap * {box-sizing:border-box;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:break-word;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd, p, div, span, section, i, form, fieldset, input, table, tr, th, td, button, textarea, br {margin:0;padding:0;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap i {font-style:normal;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd {list-style:none;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap img {width:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;width:100%;max-width:1200px !important;font-weight:400;margin:0 auto;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:-0.05em;-webkit-letter-spacing:-0.25px;text-align:center;color:#424242;line-height:1.4;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT SIZE CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap p {transform:rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {font-size:1.5em;}/*18px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {font-size:2em;}/*24px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {font-size:2.3333em;}/*28px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {font-size:2.6667em;}/*32px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {font-size:4em;}/*48px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {font-size:6.6667em;}/*80px*/\r\n\r\n            /* FONT STYLE CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .fw_600 {font-weight:600;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_10 {line-height:1;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_12 {line-height:1.2;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ta_l {text-align:left;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ta_r {text-align:right;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .t_up {text-transform:uppercase;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT COLOR CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_white {color:#fff;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_whitegray {color:#bfbfbf;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_gray {color:#666;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_black {color:#121212;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_red {color:#ad0509;}\r\n\r\n            /* BG COLOR CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_white {background-color:#fff;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_whitegray {background-color:#f9f9f9;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_darkgray {background-color:#adadad;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_gray {background-color:#bfbfbf;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_black {background-color:#121212;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_red {background-color:#ad0509;}\r\n\r\n            /* MARGIN CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_02em {margin-top:0.2em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_04em {margin-top:0.4em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_4em {margin-top:4em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt-1em {margin-top:-1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt-05em {margin-top:-0.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_1em {margin-top:1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {margin-top:10px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {margin-top:20px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {margin-top:30px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_40 {margin-top:40px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {margin-top:50px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {margin-top:70px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_80 {margin-top:80px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_90 {margin-top:90px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_100 {margin-top:100px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {margin-top:150px;}\r\n\r\n            /* PADDING CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_05em {padding-top:0.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_06em {padding-top:0.6em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_3em {padding-top:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_80 {padding-top:80px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_05em {padding-bottom:0.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_2em {padding-bottom:2em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_3em {padding-bottom:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_70 {padding-bottom:70px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:80px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pl_40 {padding-left:40px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pl_1em {padding-left:1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pl_3em {padding-left:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pr_1em {padding-right:1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pr_3em {padding-right:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_6p {padding:6%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_1em {padding:1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_2em {padding:2em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_3em {padding:3em;}\r\n            \r\n            /* GRID · FLEX 스타일 */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_2step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 49%);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_3step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 32%);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_4step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 23.8%);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_textList {display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.4167em auto;justify-content:center;align-items:start;gap:1.25em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_c {display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_c_auto {flex:auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}\r\n\r\n            /* 기타 스타일 */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w75 {width:75%;margin-left:12.5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w80 {width:80%;margin-left:10%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w90 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mgAuto {margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pos_r {position:relative;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .wMax {width:max-content;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .wFit {width:fit-content;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10 {border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10v {border-radius:10px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .border_lineBox {border:1px solid #121212;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .top_TitleBar {display:inline-block;width:50%;border-radius:0 0 1em 1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Round_TitleBar {display:inline-block;border-radius:200px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Box_Shadow {-webkit-box-shadow:0 0 1.25em 0.5em rgba(0,0,0,0.04); box-shadow:0 0 1.25em 0.5em rgba(0,0,0,0.04);}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {display:none;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {display:block;}\r\n\r\n            /* 타이틀 */\r\n            .Product_Title .ProductName i {background-color:#fff;padding:0 1em;}\r\n            .Product_Title .ProductName::after {content: '';position:absolute;display:block;width:100%;height:1px;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -0.1em);background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#d9d9d9 20%,#d9d9d9 80%,#fff 100%);z-index:-1;}\r\n            .NumberBox {display:inline-block;padding:0.5em 0.684em 0.4em;border-radius:100%;background-color:#ad0509;}\r\n\r\n            /* 키이미지 */\r\n            .KeyImg .key_TextBox {position:absolute;top:17%;}\r\n            \r\n            /* 제너럴 밸런스 알티지 플러스 제품특징 */\r\n            .Product_Features {display:grid;grid-template-columns:28.5% 1fr;column-gap:5em;}\r\n            .Product_Features img {margin-top:0.5em;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li {display:flex;width:100%;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px dotted #424242;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li p {padding:0.15em 0 0.05em;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li:last-of-type {border-bottom:none;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li p:nth-of-type(1) {margin-left:0.2em;}\r\n            .Product_Features .flex_box li p:nth-of-type(2) {margin-left:0.8em;line-height:1.2;}\r\n\r\n            /* 오메가3* + 비타민 + 미네랄 복합 기능성 제품 */\r\n            .Complex_Function {width:80vw;max-width:780px;}\r\n            .Complex_Function li {position:absolute;;width:23.3333%;height:27.2455%;padding:0.5em;}\r\n            .Complex_Function li:nth-of-type(1) {top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);}\r\n            .Complex_Function li:nth-of-type(2) {top:14.6707%;left:7.5641%;}\r\n            .Complex_Function li:nth-of-type(3) {top:14.6707%;right:7.5641%;}\r\n\r\n            /* 혈행 건강과 건조한 눈을 위한 오메가-3 (EPA 및 DHA 함유 유지) 900mg 함유 */\r\n            .Vegetable_Membrane {width:50vw;max-width:432px;}\r\n            .Vegetable_Membrane > div {position:absolute;bottom:0;right:0;transform:translateX(25%);}\r\n            .Vegetable_Membrane p {padding:0.5em 1.5em 0.3em;border:0.1em solid #fff;border-radius:0em 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em;}\r\n            .Vegetable_Membrane p:after {content:'';position:absolute;width:0;height:0;top:0;left:0;border:0.8em solid transparent;border-top:0.8em solid #ad0509;transform:translate(-50%, -49%) rotate(45deg);}\r\n            .Vegetable_Membrane p::before {content:'';position:absolute;width:0;height:0;top:0;left:0;border:1em solid transparent;border-top:1em solid #fff;transform:translate(calc(-50% - 0.15em), calc(-49% - 0.1em)) rotate(45deg);}\r\n\r\n            /* 오메가3*는 왜 섭취해야 할까요? */\r\n            .Raw_Material {position:absolute;top:72%;}\r\n            .EPA-DHA {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 25%);justify-content:space-between;}\r\n            .EPA-DHA img {width:10vw;max-width:86px;}\r\n            .EPA-DHA li:after {content:'';position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:0;height:100%;border-right:1px dotted #bbbbbb;}\r\n            .EPA-DHA li:last-of-type::after {display:none;}\r\n            .Test_Result:after {content:'';position:absolute;width:100%;height:0;top:0.6em;left:0;border-top:0.0625em solid #121212;z-index:-1;}\r\n            .Test_Result span {display:inline-block;padding:0 1em;}\r\n            \r\n            /* 체내 흡수와 이용이 용이한 rTG 타입 */\r\n            .rTG_Type {display:grid;grid-template-columns:30% 30% 37%;justify-content:space-between;}\r\n            .rTG_Type .circle_box {width:16em;height:16em;border:0.2em solid #121212;border-radius:100%;}\r\n            .rTG_Type .circle_box > .in_Box {position:absolute;width:6.5em;height:6.5em;border-radius:100%;}\r\n            .rTG_Type .circle_box > .in_Box:nth-child(1) {top:0;right:0;transform:translate(15%, -15%);}\r\n            .rTG_Type .circle_box > .in_Box:nth-child(2) {top:0;left:0;transform:translate(-15%, -15%);}\r\n            .rTG_Type .circle_box > .in_Box:nth-child(3) {bottom:0;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, 50%);}\r\n            .rTG_Type li:nth-child(3) {border:0.25em solid #ad0509;}\r\n\r\n            /* 12종의 비타민과 2종의 미네랄을 한번에! */\r\n            .Vitamin_Mineral li {border-top:0.25em solid #121212;-webkit-box-shadow:0 0 1.25em 0.5em rgba(0,0,0,0.04); box-shadow:0 0 1.25em 0.5em rgba(0,0,0,0.04);}\r\n\r\n            /* 부원료 헤마토코쿠스추출물 함유 */\r\n            .Haematococcus {position:absolute;top:15%;}\r\n            .Haematococcus_mark {position:absolute;bottom:5%;}\r\n            \r\n            /* 권장 대상 */\r\n            .Recommended_Target {display:grid;grid-template-columns:46% 1fr;justify-content:center;align-items:center;column-gap:4em;}\r\n\r\n            /* 브랜드 스토리 */\r\n            .Brand_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 56%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#ccc solid 1px;text-align:left;}\r\n            .Brand_Grid .logo_img {max-width:40% !important;margin-top:1em;}\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1200px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {margin-top:0.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {margin-top:1.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {margin-top:2.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_40 {margin-top:3.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {margin-top:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {margin-top:5.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_80 {margin-top:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_90 {margin-top:7.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_100 {margin-top:8.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {margin-top:12.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pt_80 {padding-top:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_70 {padding-bottom:5.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pl_40 {padding-left:3.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10, .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10v {border-radius:0.8333vw;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1020px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:10px;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {font-size:1.8em;}/*18px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {font-size:2.4em;}/*24px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {font-size:2.8em;}/*28px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {font-size:3.2em;}/*32px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {font-size:4.8em;}/*48px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {font-size:7em;}/*80px*/\r\n                .grid_textList img {margin-top:0.2em;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:920px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:9px;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .w75, .Product_DetailWrap .w80 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {display:block;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {display:none;}\r\n                .Product_Features .flex_box li p {padding:0.3em 0 0.2em;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:820px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:8px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:7px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:620px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:6px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:510px) {\r\n                .Brand_Grid {grid-template-columns:1fr;row-gap:4.1667vw;text-align:center;}\r\n                .Brand_Grid .logo_img {margin-top:0 !important;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:520px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:5px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:420px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:4px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:320px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:3px;}\r\n            }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"Product_DetailWrap\">\n<section class=\"KeyImg pos_r\">\n<div class=\"key_TextBox w90 color_white\">\n<p class=\"p4\">14가지 복합기능을 한번에 섭취!</p>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB mt_02em lh_12\">제너럴 밸런스 알티지 플러스</p>\n<p class=\"p2 font_NMr color_whitegray mt_02em\">General Balance r-TG Plus</p>\n<p class=\"p2 mt_40\">기초건강, 활력생성, 혈행건강, 눈 건강까지<br/>\r\n손쉽게 관리하세요!</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/rTG_Plus/20260414/rTG_Pllus_keyimg.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"w90 mt_150\">\n<div class=\"Product_Features ta_l mt_50\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/rTG_Plus/20260414/rTG_Pllus_img_01.jpg\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p5 color_black lh_12\">제너럴 밸런스 알티지 플러스 <span class=\"fw_600 color_red\">제품특징</span></p>\n<ul class=\"flex_box mt_20\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">1</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">오메가3* + 비타민 + 미네랄 복합 기능성 제품</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">2</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">혈행건강과 건조한 눈을 위한 오메가3 900mg 함유</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">3</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">r-TG 오메가3 원료 사용</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">4</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">11종의 비타민과 2종의 미네랄을 한번에!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NMb color_black\">5</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">개별포장으로 안정성과 휴대성 UP!</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p1 ta_r mt_10\">* 오메가3 : EPA 및 DHA 함유 유지</p>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"Product_Title mt_150\">\n<p class=\"ProductName pos_r font_NMr t_up lh_12\"><i>General Balance</i></p>\n<p class=\"font_NMeb lh_12\">r-TG PLUS</p>\n<p class=\"p5 font_NGB color_black mt_04em\">제품 특징</p>\n<p class=\"p1 font_NMr mt_02em\">KEY POINT</p>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"w90 mt_50\">\n<div class=\"NumberBox font_NMb p5 color_white lh_10\">1</div>\n<p class=\"p5 fw_600 color_black mt_20\">오메가3* + 비타민 + 미네랄 복합 기능성 제품</p>\n<div class=\"Complex_Function mt_50 co